+# Personal agent config kept out of the source tree.
+#
+# Personas resolve from two scopes: `~/.grok/personas/` (user) and
+# `<cwd>/.grok/personas/` (project) — and the second one lands inside whatever
+# repository the session runs in, this fork included. Nothing under `.grok/`
